    - target: {fileID: 455263753006549881, guid: 794bf3b2a8574114b9627570925af8c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: artifactTitle
      value: 'Architectural Terracotta Stupa Base with Kudu Niches '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 455263753006549881, guid: 794bf3b2a8574114b9627570925af8c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: alternateModel
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1414193450}
    - target: {fileID: 455263753006549881, guid: 794bf3b2a8574114b9627570925af8c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: artifactDescription
      value: '- Dating / Period: 12th-14th centuries Buddhist Era (approx. 7th-9th
        centuries CE)

        - Dimensions: Diameter: 11.50 cm | Height: 16.50 cm

        -
        Material: Baked clay with applied relief and red mineral pigment traces

        -
        Discovery Location: Excavated at Ancient Monument Mound No. 3, Ban Jaleh,
        Yarang Ancient City, Pattani Province

        - Current Repository: Fine
        Arts Department Office No. 11, Songkhla

        - Description: A cylindrical
        architectural stupa base featuring decorative details created through the
        applied clay technique (pan-pae). The lower rim is bordered by a tooth/gear
        frieze supporting alternating blind horseshoe-arch niches (kudu) flanked
        by slender rounded pilasters. Adjacent panels display blind rectangular windows
        fitted with vertical wooden-style balustrade bars (lak krong mai). The upper
        register is crowned with false projecting roof rafters (khue), four-petaled
        floral rosettes, and an upward-lotus moulding that originally supported a
        dome and tiered spire. This artifact illustrates early Dvaravati-Gupta architectural
        styles replicated on a miniature scale.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 455263753006549881, guid: 794bf3b2a8574114b9627570925af8c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: spatialToggleButtonAnchor
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1462677003}
    - target: {fileID: 455263753006549881, guid: 794bf3b2a8574114b9627570925af8c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: localizedTitle.m_TableEntryReference.m_KeyId
      value: 291722586148870
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 455263753006549881, guid: 794bf3b2a8574114b9627570925af8c9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: localizedDescription.m_TableEntryReference.m_KeyId
